{"availability":"available","full":"bartekmp/osmosmjerka","name":"osmosmjerka","description":"Web-based word search game with a language learning twist.","category":"Education","language":"JavaScript","stars":4,"forks":1,"created":"2025-06-24T14:09:32Z","updated":"2026-10-07T18:22:35Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://osmosmjerka.app","topics":["fastapi","game","react","webapp","wordsearch","wordsearch-creator","wordsearch-puzzle"],"demo":"https://osmosmjerka.lel.lu/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T20:12:11.135Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T20:12:11.135Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T20:12:11.135Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:07:05.383Z","stars":4,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:12:11.135Z","stars":4,"forks":1}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A feature-rich web-based word search game with language learning capabilities","Osmosmjerka (Croatian for \"eight-direction word search puzzle\") is a modern, multilingual word search game designed for language learners. Each puzzle is themed with categorized phrases that include translations, turning gameplay into an engaging flashcard-style learning experience.","Create private phrase lists to save words and expressions you want to practice later. Each phrase added via the Learn This Later button during gameplay is automatically saved to your personal collection for future study. You can also create your own lists and import phrases from external sources. Learn This Later is a built-in private list and cannot be removed."],"features":["🧩 Two Game Modes - Classic Word Search (find hidden phrases) and Crossword (produce the word from its translation clue)","🎯 Smart Puzzle Generation - Intelligent algorithm creates challenging grids with maximized phrase intersections (Algorithm Details)","🌍 Multi-language Support - Full i18n with English, Croatian, and Polish (easily extensible)","🎨 Dark/Light Themes - Comfortable viewing in any lighting condition","💾 Auto-save Progress - Resume your game exactly where you left off"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bartekmp/osmosmjerka/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"52124e3585d7a93b790c2e46237ccd68cb2aec3acdff2b33b4b8494e58ffedbd","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:07:05.656Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T20:16:38.686Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A feature-rich web-based word search game with language learning capabilities","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bartekmp/osmosmjerka/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Osmosmjerka (Croatian for \"eight-direction word search puzzle\") is a modern, multilingual word search game designed for language learners. Each puzzle is themed with categorized phrases that include translations, turning gameplay into an engaging flashcard-style learning experience.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bartekmp/osmosmjerka/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"🎮 Live Demo • Use demo / demo to login","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bartekmp/osmosmjerka/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Create the database and user account, then update POSTGRES variables in .env.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bartekmp/osmosmjerka/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"52124e3585d7a93b790c2e46237ccd68cb2aec3acdff2b33b4b8494e58ffedbd","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bartekmp/osmosmjerka/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T20:16:38.687Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-07T18:22:35Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bartekmp/osmosmjerka/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T20:16:38.689Z","hash":"52124e3585d7a93b790c2e46237ccd68cb2aec3acdff2b33b4b8494e58ffedbd","originalBytes":24016,"storedBytes":24016,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["phrases","management","admin","phrase","language","lists","list","assets","docs","learning","osmosmjerka","user","create","data